Field descriptions:
- mythic_items: Mythic tier items (legendary grade, one per build)
- strong_counters: Champions this champion performs well against. win_rate and my_win_rate are the selected champion win rate; counter_win_rate is the opponent win rate.
- weak_counters: Counter picks against this champion. win_rate and counter_win_rate are the counter champion win rate; my_win_rate is the selected champion win rate into that counter.
- strong_counters[].my_win_rate: Selected champion win rate against this opponent champion.
- strong_counters[].counter_win_rate: Opponent champion win rate against the selected champion.
- weak_counters[].my_win_rate: Selected champion win rate against this counter pick.
- weak_counters[].counter_win_rate: Counter pick win rate against the selected champion.
- counters_meta: Optional metadata about counter sample sufficiency. Present only when strong_counters or weak_counters are empty due to insufficient matchup sample; include this field when querying counters so empty-result cases are explained instead of silent.
- damage_type: Champion damage type (AD=Attack Damage, AP=Ability Power, BOTH=Hybrid)
- skill_combos: Recommended champion skill combos with demo video links
- skill_masteries: Priority order for maxing abilities (Q/W/E)

